b1 is a text with value "Web applications", size 40, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.03em", lineheight "1.1"
b2 is a text with value "otter web compiles an Otter program into a standalone HTML, CSS and JavaScript application. You write the page in Otter: no HTML, no build tool.", size 18, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.55"
b3 is a text with value "otter web app.ot", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable false
b3label is a text with value "PowerShell", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b3copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b3head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b3label, b3copy in b3head
b3block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b3head, b3 in b3block
when b3copy is clicked
    copy text of b3 to clipboard
    text of b3copy is "Copied"
.
b4 is a text with value "Describing a page", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b5 is a text with value "Each part of the page is a named resource. is a declares it, with lets you set properties on the same line, and put places it inside another.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b6 is a text with value "app is a page with title \"Greeter\", width 560, background \"#0f172a\", spacing 14\n\nnameBox is a text box with placeholder \"Your name\"\nhelloButton is a button with text \"Say hello\", background \"#6366f1\", foreground \"white\"\nmessage is a text with value \"Waiting...\", foreground \"#a7f3d0\"\n\nwhen helloButton is clicked\n    entered is text of nameBox\n    text of message is entered\n.\n\nput nameBox, helloButton, message in app\nshow app", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b6label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b6copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b6head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b6label, b6copy in b6head
b6block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b6head, b6 in b6block
when b6copy is clicked
    copy text of b6 to clipboard
    text of b6copy is "Copied"
.
b7 is a text with value "Resources include page, text, text box, button, image, link, card, row, column, badge and more. Layout words such as spread, align middle and spacing arrange rows and columns. customstyle passes raw CSS for anything else. scroll true on a page lets it scroll like an ordinary website.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b7a is a text with value "Stylesheets and projects", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b7b is a text with value "To style a page with your own CSS, put a stylesheet named after the program beside it: app.css for app.ot, or main.css for a project's main.ot. otter web, otter build and otter publish include it in the page; otter new web creates main.css for you. It is the only stylesheet Otter 1.0 picks up. The generated page uses the computer's own fonts and needs no internet connection or other service.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b7c is a text with value "A web or game project runs with otter web . (console and automation projects use otter run .). Keep the entry point at the project root: when it is in a subfolder, relative paths to images and other assets break after otter build (to be fixed after 1.0).", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b8 is a text with value "Several pages and routes", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b9 is a text with value "homePage is a page with title \"Home\"\naboutPage is a page with title \"About\"\nnotFoundPage is a page with title \"Not Found\"\n\nroute \"/\" shows homePage\nroute \"/about\" shows aboutPage\nroute \"/users/:id\" shows userPage\nroute otherwise shows notFoundPage\n\ngo to \"/about\"\ngo back", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b9label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b9copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b9head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b9label, b9copy in b9head
b9block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b9head, b9 in b9block
when b9copy is clicked
    copy text of b9 to clipboard
    text of b9copy is "Copied"
.
b10 is a text with value "Drag and drop", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b11 is a text with value "Make things draggable, mark where they can be dropped, and react:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b12 is a text with value "card is panel with draggable is true\nboard is panel with accepts drops is true\n\non drag of card\n    set drag data to \"task-42\"\n.\n\non drop on board\n    say drag data\n    say drop x\n    say drop y\n.", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b12label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b12copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b12head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b12label, b12copy in b12head
b12block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b12head, b12 in b12block
when b12copy is clicked
    copy text of b12 to clipboard
    text of b12copy is "Copied"
.
b13 is a text with value "on files dropped on board gives you dropped files, a list of file values. Drag and drop is available in web applications.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b14 is a text with value "What the web target leaves out", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b15 is a text with value "Raw sockets (TCP, UDP, TLS), file watching, the credential vault, cryptography, databases and direct file access need the operating system, so the web target reports them as unsupported rather than pretending.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b15a is a text with value "Everything else works the same way as in the console, and say formats values the same way on both. A few results still differ: comparing two lists with is (the console compares their items, the web only whether they are the same list), the layout of convert ... to json text, contains on a list of numbers given a number written as text, ordering comparisons on text, repeat with a fractional count, when x changes, if x is empty, stop at the top of a program, and the wording of some error messages.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b16 is a link with text "Next: state and reactivity", url "/reactivity/", foreground "#2563eb", weight 600, size 15

docsMain is a column with spacing 16, flex 1, padding "40px 56px 24px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; max-width: 940px;"
put b1, b2, b3block, b4, b5, b6block, b7, b7a, b7b, b7c, b8, b9block, b10, b11, b12block, b13, b14, b15, b15a, b16 in docsMain
docsBody is a row with align top, spacing 0, width full, customstyle "align-items: stretch;"
put docsSidebar, docsMain in docsBody

put topBar, docsBody, siteFooter in app
show app
